    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Breeder Simulator: A Game Where Monsters Go on Adventures Themselves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, the player takes control of a base dedicated to raising and crossbreeding monsters. Roads stretch out in all directions from the base, filled with adventures, treasures, and other monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ran out of monsters? No problem! Skip a day, and new ones will be born in your basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base, explore the map, and create the rarest and most valuable monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned for release:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global map packed with quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 base monsters for evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 400 types of evolved monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 hours of gameplay to complete the main story, with endless possibilities for discovering new evolution combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this evolution adventure and become the ultimate monster breeder!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Breeder Simulator: A Game Where Monsters Go on Adventures Themselves</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, the player takes control of a base dedicated to raising and crossbreeding monsters. Roads stretch out in all directions from the base, filled with adventures, treasures, and other monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ran out of monsters? No problem! Skip a day, and new ones will be born in your basement.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your base, explore the map, and create the rarest and most valuable monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planned for release:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global map packed with quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 30 base monsters for evolution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 400 types of evolved monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 20 hours of gameplay to complete the main story, with endless possibilities for discovering new evolution combinations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on this evolution adventure and become the ultimate monster breeder!</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Evolution Adventure&quot; is an adventure game with elements of deck-building, idle mechanics, and the creation of your own unique monsters. Discover unique combinations and crossbreed creatures in the evolution chamber. Unravel all the mysteries and find all the monsters.",
